{
  "name": "10 · Customer Onboarding Automation (SaaS)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 10 · Customer Onboarding Automation (SaaS)\n**What it does:** When a new customer signs up (webhook), it enriches their data, AI-personalizes a welcome email, provisions their account in the CRM/tracker, notifies the success team on Slack, and logs to the onboarding pipeline.\n\n**Why it sells:** SaaS companies lose customers in the first 30 days due to slow, generic onboarding. This makes onboarding instant, personalized, and tracked. **Sell at:** $600-1000 setup + $200-350/mo.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "s10-title",
      "name": "Sticky: Title & ROI",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Signup Webhook\n**Webhook** receives new signup: name, email, company, plan.\n\n**Demo:** manual trigger with sample signup.\nValidate: email format, name present, plan in allowed list.\nIdempotency: email+date key prevents double-onboarding.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "s10-input",
      "name": "Sticky: Signup Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### AI Personalization\nGemini writes a personalized welcome email:\n- References their company + plan\n- Suggests relevant first steps\n- Warm, human tone (not generic)\n\nConfidence gate: low-confidence → generic template fallback.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "s10-ai",
      "name": "Sticky: AI Personalization",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Provision + Notify\n- Add customer to CRM/onboarding tracker (Sheets)\n- Send personalized welcome email (Gmail)\n- Notify success team on Slack\n- Log to onboarding pipeline\n\nCustomer gets instant, personalized onboarding. Success team gets a heads-up. Nothing falls through cracks.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "s10-output",
      "name": "Sticky: Provision + Notify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1180,
        -80
      ]
    },
